    {
      "text": "It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It loves eating mushrooms that grow under dead grass. It also finds hot springs while foraging.",
      "version": "diamond"
